        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience has the ability to vote and is politically active enough to do so.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a moral obligation to reciprocate risks taken by soldiers through participation in democracy.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
