        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The current lack of congressional consultation undermines the democratic foundation of foreign policy.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "America’s role in global security should not exceed its capacity or mandate to avoid overextension.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
