      {
        "text": "Congress has continued to rely on outdated AUMFs instead of passing new legislation.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Members of Congress appear reluctant to exercise their constitutional responsibility regarding military authorization.",
        "confidence": 0.92
