    "turn_idx": 13,
    "turn_text": "Between 1965 and 1975, close to 70% of members in each chamber had some form of military experience, but only 18% of the 118th Congress are veterans. How do you think your experience as an Army Ranger and a member of the 101st Airborne affects how you interpret foreign policy questions compared to colleagues who haven't served?",
