        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Voting is a civic responsibility owed to service members deployed in combat.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Returning fire against enemies using women as human shields was necessary to protect the unit.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Many veterans tend to support greater military engagement than the speaker supports.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
