        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Six soldiers from the speaker's unit died during a mission in Somalia involving Moby-Dishu.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Congress should fulfill its constitutional role in declaring war and making war-related decisions.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
