        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Public accountability through voting strengthens democratic legitimacy in military action.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Moral clarity in combat situations requires acting decisively even when outcomes involve civilian casualties.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Congressional passivity in wartime matters undermines national commitment to military efforts.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "People who advocate for war without personal sacrifice lack credibility in evaluating military risks.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The emotional burden of combat experiences shapes long-term ethical reflection among veterans.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Democratic institutions function best when citizens face consequences for their choices regarding war.",
