        "text": "Physical courage and bravery are necessary qualities for political leadership regarding military matters.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Democratic and sovereign status for Ukraine is inherently valuable and worth pursuing.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "A clear strategy for supporting Ukraine was expected and appropriate to demand.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a moral obligation for elected officials to take personal risks similar to soldiers.",
