  {
    "episode_id": 84578,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84578.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 19,
    "turn_text": "So, you know, the aid currently does appear to be frozen in the House. I'm curious, do you foresee a coming for Ukraine coming out of the house anytime soon? I mean, if it were up to you, what would you be pushing on this?",
